        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Masaharu Iwata\n- Companies: Bothtec\n- Products: Final Fantasy XII\n- Concepts: video game composition, Chocobos, Moogles\n\nFacts:\n- Masaharu Iwata was born on October 26, 1966, and he is a Japanese video game composer.\n- After graduating from high school, Masaharu Iwata worked on musical projects that included composing on a synthesizer and playing in a cover band.\n- After high school, Masaharu Iwata joined Bothtec as a composer.\n- Final Fantasy XII includes elements from earlier games in the series, including Chocobos and Moogles.",
